{"action":"hero","hero":{"shot":"shots/reunion.js","who":"noor"},"what":"the ten successive drawings of ONE slow walk cycle (two steps) seen from the side, walking toward the viewer's RIGHT, in order: an unhurried, long-legged, level stroll, BOTH HANDS IN THE COAT'S POCKETS in every drawing, the arms never swing. TOP ROW, their LEFT foot (the far one) carries them while their RIGHT leg (the near one) swings through: (1) the left heel has just come down in front, the right toe still on the ground behind; (2) the weight is on the left foot, the right heel peels up; (3) passing: the left leg straight under them, the right knee bent, coming through; (4) the right leg swings out ahead; (5) the right heel reaches for the ground. BOTTOM ROW, the same on the other foot: the RIGHT foot carries them and the LEFT leg swings through. The head is upright and level in every drawing, the face in profile, deadpan, looking straight ahead, never down. The long open coat falls to the ankles and the long hair hangs down the back to the waist; both trail and swing a little behind them with each step. Both heavy boots show whole in every drawing.","loose":true,"float":false,"prop":null,"view":"reun_side","yaw":null,"elev":null,"W":2752,"H":1536,"cols":5,"rows":2,"unit":334,"aspect":"16:9","cels":[{"index":0,"name":"rs_0","frame":377,"action":"noor_walk","cel":0,"from":{"yaw":-104.7,"elev":5.4},"box":[0,0,550,768],"ground":[271.22,681.2],"joints":{"hips":[300.86,365.91],"waist":[307.66,313.57],"chest":[318.47,230.43],"neckBase":[325.27,178.16],"headBase":[327.98,153.88],"head":[331.77,113.52],"crown":[335.54,73.28],"L.sh":[304.67,188.43],"L.elbow":[270.61,277.69],"L.wrist":[312.41,346.33],"L.hand":[327.24,370.68],"L.hip":[294.78,363.07],"L.knee":[325.6,499.64],"L.ankle":[355.07,636.75],"L.heel":[337.04,669.93],"L.toe":[423.91,643.8],"R.sh":[342.76,194.69],"R.elbow":[316.71,287.87],"R.wrist":[350.76,363.23],"R.hand":[362.85,390.01],"R.hip":[307.01,368.78],"R.knee":[246.37,514.34],"R.ankle"